# Line-ending policy.
#
# The agent-system tooling (validators, auditors, security scanners, hooks) parses
# repository text with LF semantics. A CRLF checkout on Windows silently breaks that
# parsing. Store every text file with LF in the repository AND check it out as LF on
# every platform, regardless of the local core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must keep CRLF to stay runnable by the Windows command interpreter.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never line-ending convert and never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.webm binary
